            name: "June-bearing strawberries for Western Oregon and Washington",
            description: "OSU EC 1618 lists these June-bearing strawberry cultivars as adapted to conditions west of the Cascades. Commercial value ratings use the source scale where 1 is appropriate for most commercial operations, 2 may have specific commercial value, and 3 is unlikely to have good commercial value"
        },
        {
            name: "Day-neutral strawberries for Western Oregon and Washington",
            description: "OSU EC 1618 lists these day-neutral strawberry cultivars as adapted to conditions west of the Cascades. Commercial value ratings use the source scale where 1 is appropriate for most commercial operations, 2 may have specific commercial value, and 3 is unlikely to have good commercial value"
